{"id":"en_she-stole-my-epipen-my-family-made-her-pay","title":"She Stole My EpiPen. My Family Made Her Pay","titleEn":"She Stole My EpiPen. My Family Made Her Pay","description":"Madison, the childhood sweetheart of the narrator's boyfriend, discovers the narrator's peanut allergy and then conceals peanut extract in every appetizer served at a party. As the narrator's airway closes, she grabs for her EpiPen only to discover it has been replaced with a candy toy. Her boyfriend dismisses her as a drama queen. Rather than keep explaining, she activates a hidden SOS button on her watch, which alerts her family's private security team.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-stole-my-epipen-my-family-made-her-pay/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-stole-my-epipen-my-family-made-her-pay/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dii72/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_she-stole-my-epipen-my-family-made-her-pay_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dii72/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-stole-my-epipen-my-family-made-her-pay_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dii72/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-stole-my-epipen-my-family-made-her-pay_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dii72/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-stole-my-epipen-my-family-made-her-pay_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble